# Friends, rivals and feelings (Docs/Design/62-talk.md, phase 7): chains for talk.friends, talk.quarrel, talk.day and
# talk.smalltalk. Each family opens with a rule that tags its thread for the talk (conv.thread=jest,
# wager, settle, confide, plan, recall, apart, jibe, mend, chat); the other answers as THEY are (jest.answer,
# wager.answer...), and that answer remembers how it went (conv.went=...); the opener closes (reply.close) by the
# thread, how it went, and their own character. So a tease can land, be thrown back, sting a short temper or worry a
# nervy one, and the teaser makes up, shrugs or gloats as they are.
#
# A reply's `|` alternatives can't see which line the opener said, so where a reply needs to know what kind of thing
# was said, the opener remembers it for the answer to read (jk: the tease's kind; cf: the confidence's; plankind: the
# plan's; rc: the memory's; jb: the jibe's; ch: the greeting's). Replies with a trait and no kind must fit every opener.

# ================================================================== Teasing (talk.friends -> jest.answer -> close)
# jk: look (how they look), age, job (their work), ways (their habits and life), rich (their money).

rule r7_tease_any
when concept=talk.friends
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jest jk=look} Have you done something different with your fur? Don't. Whatever it is, don't. | {thread=jest jk=look} You walk like a wolf who's forgotten why they came out. | {thread=jest jk=look} I'd know that scowl anywhere. Good to see it. | {thread=jest jk=look} Look at you. Like a pup who's been at the honey. | {thread=jest jk=look} Your coat's buttoned wrong. Every button. That takes skill.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_merry
when concept=talk.friends self.humour=merry
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=look} You've got something on your muzzle. No, other side. No, sorry, that's just your face. | {thread=jest jk=look} Who brushed your fur this morning, a gale? | {thread=jest jk=look} I saw your tail from the end of the street. It's got a kink in it. Have you sat on it? | {thread=jest jk=look} Your ears have gone lopsided. Has someone been pulling them? | {thread=jest jk=look} Here comes the handsomest wolf in town. Oh, no, they've gone past. It's only you.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_dry
when concept=talk.friends self.humour=dry
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} I see you've dressed for the occasion. What occasion, I can't imagine. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Good to see you. Well. To see you. | {thread=jest jk=ways} I'd ask how you are, but I've a busy afternoon. | {thread=jest jk=ways} You've the look of a wolf with a plan. It's a bad plan. I can tell from here. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Your ears are doing that thing. The thing where you've had an idea.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_old
when concept=talk.friends self.stage=adult other.stage=old pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=age} Still with us, then? The gods must be busy elsewhere. | {thread=jest jk=age} Mind you don't fall over, old timer. I'm not carrying you home. | {thread=jest jk=age} You're greyer than last week. I'm counting the hairs. | {thread=jest jk=age} How many winters now? I've lost count. So have you, I expect.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_young
when concept=talk.friends self.stage=old other.stage=adult|adolescent pair.band=friends
does tease
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} Look at you, all teeth and no sense. | {thread=jest jk=ways} When I was your age I'd done a day's work by now. And half of yours. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Is that a ruff you're growing? Brave. Very brave. | {thread=jest jk=ways} You young ones. Always running about like the river's on fire.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_rich
when concept=talk.friends self.wealth=poor|comfortable other.wealth=rich pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=rich} Look at the coat on you. I could live a month in that coat. | {thread=jest jk=rich} Brushed, scented, a new collar. Did a rich aunt leave you a mill? | {thread=jest jk=rich} Careful, you'll scuff those boots on us common folk. | {thread=jest jk=rich} Spare a penny for an old friend, your worship?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_poor
when concept=talk.friends self.wealth=rich other.wealth=poor|destitute pair.band=friends self.humour=merry|dry
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=look} Still wearing that cloak? It was old when we were pups. | {thread=jest jk=look} That hat's seen more winters than you have. | {thread=jest jk=look} You've a hole in your boot. I can see your toes waving at me.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_guard
when concept=talk.friends other.role=guard pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} Caught any villains today, or just leant on that spear? | {thread=jest jk=job} Stand up straight, the Watch is watching. | {thread=jest jk=job} That helmet's so bright I can see my muzzle in it. Is that all you do all day, polish? | {thread=jest jk=job} If my till's light tomorrow I'll know who was asleep at the gate.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_merchant
when concept=talk.friends other.role=merchant pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} Sold anyone their own boots back today? | {thread=jest jk=job} I hear your scales lean your way. | {thread=jest jk=job} What's the price of a smile from you these days? Two pennies? | {thread=jest jk=job} Don't charge me for talking to you, mind.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_baker
when concept=talk.friends other.job=baker|cook pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} You've flour in your ears again. | {thread=jest jk=job} You smell of fresh bread. It's cruel, is what it is. | {thread=jest jk=job} Burnt anything today? Go on, you can tell me.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_smith
when concept=talk.friends other.job=smith pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} Your brows have grown back, I see. Stood too near the fire again? | {thread=jest jk=job} Ears still ringing? WHAT? I SAID, ARE YOUR EARS STILL RINGING? | {thread=jest jk=job} You smell like a hot horseshoe.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_fisher
when concept=talk.friends other.job=fisher|sailor pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} I smelt you before I saw you. | {thread=jest jk=job} Catch anything, or did they all see you coming? | {thread=jest jk=job} There's a scale stuck in your ruff. No, leave it. It suits you.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_farmer
when concept=talk.friends other.job=farmer|herder pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} You've half a field on your boots. | {thread=jest jk=job} How are the turnips? Still better company than you? | {thread=jest jk=job} You've straw in your tail. Again. Do you sleep in the barn?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_priest
when concept=talk.friends other.job=priest self.piety=ordinary pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=job} Say one for me, I've been busy sinning. | {thread=jest jk=job} Is it a sin to laugh in your sermon? Asking for a friend. | {thread=jest jk=job} Bless me, I've had two ciders and it's not noon.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_healer
when concept=talk.friends other.job=healer pair.band=friends
does tell.boast
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=job} Don't look at my tongue. I know that look. | {thread=jest jk=job} Cured anyone today, or just frightened them? | {thread=jest jk=job} I'm fine. Don't come near me with that bag.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_scholar
when concept=talk.friends other.job=scholar|official pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=job} Read any good ledgers lately? | {thread=jest jk=job} Your paws are all ink. Again. | {thread=jest jk=job} Use small words today. I've a headache.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_apprentice
when concept=talk.friends other.apprentice=yes self.stage=adult|old pair.band=friends|family
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=job} How's the trade? Still sweeping? | {thread=jest jk=job} Has your master let you near anything sharp yet? | {thread=jest jk=job} Learn anything today, or just how to be shouted at?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_chatty
when concept=talk.friends other.talk=chatty self.humour=dry|merry
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} You've talked since you got here and I've not heard a single full stop. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Breathe. Go on. I'll wait. | {thread=jest jk=ways} I asked you one question at noon and you're still answering it.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_quiet
when concept=talk.friends other.talk=quiet self.talk=chatty
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} Say something. Anything. Blink if you're alive. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Don't all talk at once, you'll wear yourself out. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Four words today. I've been counting.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_ambitious
when concept=talk.friends other.drive=ambitious pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} How's the empire, your lordship? | {thread=jest jk=ways} When you own the town, remember who knew you when. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Bought a House yet? Even a small one?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_devout
when concept=talk.friends other.piety=devout self.piety=ordinary self.humour=merry|dry
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} Off to chapel again? What did you do this time? | {thread=jest jk=ways} You pray so much the Bright One must hide when you come in. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Put a word in for me. A small one. They'll not know my name.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_spouse
when concept=talk.friends other.spouse pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} Does #other.spouse# know you're out? | {thread=jest jk=ways} How's #other.spouse#? Still putting up with you? | {thread=jest jk=ways} Married life suits you. You've gone soft round the middle.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_tired
when concept=talk.friends other.tired=yes
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jest jk=look} You look like you've been dragged through a hedge. Backwards. Twice. | {thread=jest jk=look} Did you sleep in a ditch? | {thread=jest jk=look} Your eyes are open. Is anyone in?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_restless
when concept=talk.friends other.drive=restless
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} Still here? I thought you'd be over the hills by now. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Your feet are tapping. They always tap before you do something stupid. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Where is it this week? The coast? The mountains? The moon?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_courting
when concept=talk.friends other.married=no other.stage=adult self.humour=merry pair.band=friends|family
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=ways} I saw you walk past the cooper's twice this morning. Twice. | {thread=jest jk=ways} Who's the lucky one, then? Your tail's giving you away. | {thread=jest jk=ways} You've brushed your ruff. You never brush your ruff. Who is it?
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_wet
when concept=talk.friends here.weather=rain|storm
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jest jk=look} You look like a drowned pup. | {thread=jest jk=look} Did you swim here? | {thread=jest jk=look} Shake yourself off before you come near me. Not at me!
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_snow
when concept=talk.friends here.weather=snow
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jest jk=look} You've snow on your ears. You look like a cake. | {thread=jest jk=look} Stand still and they'll take you for a snowdrift. | {thread=jest jk=look} Your whiskers have frozen. You look a hundred.
then other: jest.answer

rule r7_tease_heights
when concept=talk.friends other.quarter=heights self.quarter!=heights here.region=ridgemere
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {thread=jest jk=rich} Slumming it with us today? | {thread=jest jk=rich} Do they let you down from the Heights on your own? | {thread=jest jk=rich} Mind your nice boots. The street's dirty down here.
then other: jest.answer

## The teased answer, as they are (self is the one teased). Every reply here fits every tease above; where one fits
## only one kind (their looks, their money), it reads conv.jk.

rule r7_jest_plain
when concept=jest.answer
does tease.return
say {went=laughed} Ha. Very good. | {went=laughed} Oh, very droll. | {went=laughed} I walked into that, didn't I? | {went=laughed} Ha! I'll let that one go. | {went=laughed} And a good day to you too.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_merry
when concept=jest.answer self.humour=merry
does tease.return
say {went=back} Says you, with a face like a dropped pie! | {went=back} Ha! At least my own mother can tell me from the goat. | {went=back} You're one to talk. You've burrs in your tail. | {went=back} I'll laugh when it's funny. HA. There. Now it's funny.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_dry
when concept=jest.answer self.humour=dry
does tease.return
say {went=back} I'll laugh later. In private. | {went=back} Noted. Filed. Forgotten. | {went=back} Thank you. I'll treasure that one. | {went=back} Did you think of that yourself? It shows.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_short
when concept=jest.answer self.temper=short
does tease.return
say {went=stung} Watch your tongue. | {went=stung} Say that again. Slower. | {went=stung} One day you'll say that to the wrong wolf. | {went=stung} Is that meant to be clever?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_short_merry
when concept=jest.answer self.temper=short self.humour=merry
does tease.return
say {went=laughed} Careful. I bite. ...Ha! Your face! | {went=laughed} Say that again and I'll... no, all right, that was good. | {went=laughed} I ought to box your ears. I'm laughing too hard.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_nervy
when concept=jest.answer self.temper=nervy
does tease.return
say {went=worried} Is that what folk say about me? Is it? | {went=worried} Oh, don't. You'll have me fretting all day. | {went=worried} Don't. I'll be thinking about that all night.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_nervy_look
when concept=jest.answer self.temper=nervy conv.jk=look
does tease.return ask.detail
say {went=worried} Do I? Really? Is it that bad? | {went=worried} Is it that bad? Tell me straight. Is it? | {went=worried} Oh no. And I've been out all morning like this.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_cold
when concept=jest.answer self.warmth=cold
does tease.return
say {went=flat} Hm. | {went=flat} Are you finished? | {went=flat} Mm. If you say so.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_quiet
when concept=jest.answer self.talk=quiet
does tease.return
say {went=flat} *flicks an ear* | {went=flat} ... | {went=flat} *a long look* Mm.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_sly
when concept=jest.answer self.honesty=sly
does tease.return
say {went=back} That'll cost you a drink, that will. | {went=back} Funny. Remind me to tell you what I heard about you. | {went=back} Keep talking. I'm writing it all down.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_calm
when concept=jest.answer self.temper=calm
does tease.return
say {went=laughed} Very likely true. | {went=laughed} Could be. Could well be. | {went=laughed} I'll not argue. I've not the energy, and you've a point.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_calm_look
when concept=jest.answer self.temper=calm conv.jk=look
does tease.return
say {went=laughed} You're not wrong. You rarely are, about my face. | {went=laughed} It's the only face I've got. I've made my peace with it. | {went=laughed} Fair. I've seen my reflection.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_old
when concept=jest.answer self.stage=old
does tease.return
say {went=back} When you're my age you can laugh at me. You won't get to my age. I'll see to it. | {went=back} I've been mocked by better, and I'm still here. | {went=back} Laugh. I've outlived three wolves who laughed at me.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_warm
when concept=jest.answer self.warmth=warm
does tease.return
say {went=laughed} Oh, stop it. Come here, you. | {went=laughed} Ha! I've missed you, you horror. | {went=laughed} You're lucky I'm fond of you.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_devout
when concept=jest.answer self.piety=devout
does tease.return
say {went=back} The Bright One heard that. | {went=back} I'll pray for your manners. And your soul, while I'm at it. | {went=back} Mock away. I'm forgiven already.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_tired
when concept=jest.answer self.tired=yes
does tease.return
say {went=tired} Not today. I've not the strength. | {went=tired} Laugh? I can barely stand. | {went=tired} Save it for tomorrow. I'll laugh tomorrow.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_frank
when concept=jest.answer self.honesty=frank
does tease.return
say {went=flat} That was poor. You've done better. | {went=flat} Honestly? Not your best. | {went=flat} I'd laugh, but I promised myself I'd only lie on Restday.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_rich
when concept=jest.answer self.wealth=rich
does tease.return
say {went=back} Laugh away. I'll be laughing all the way home. In my carriage. | {went=back} I'd buy you a sense of humour, but they're not for sale. | {went=back} Charming. I'll put it on your bill.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_rich_money
when concept=jest.answer self.wealth=rich conv.jk=rich
does tease.return
say {went=back} Envy's an ugly colour, #pet#. | {went=back} It's a very good coat. You may touch it. Once. | {went=back} I'd lend you a penny, but you'd only buy a comb with it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jest_mourning
when concept=jest.answer self.mourning=kin|friend
does tease.return
priority 3
say {went=grief} Not today. Please. | {went=grief} I can't. Not today. | {went=grief} ...I'm not in the mood for it.
regard self: affinity -1
then other: reply.close

## The teaser closes (self is the teaser again)

rule r7_close_jest
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest
does ack
say #bc_ha# | Well, there it is. | Always a pleasure. | Anyway.

rule r7_close_jest_laughed
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=laughed
does ack
say There's my friend. | Knew you'd see it. | That's better. You never laugh enough. | Ha! That's the face I like.

rule r7_close_jest_back
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=back
does ack
say Ha! Fair. I'll have that. | Oh, that's good. I'm stealing that. | All right, all right. You win this one. | I'll get you tomorrow. You won't see it coming.

rule r7_close_jest_back_short
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=back self.temper=short
does ack
say Hm. Clever. | Watch it. | I'll let that go. This once.

rule r7_close_jest_stung
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=stung
does ack
say Easy! I'm only pulling your tail. | Hey. I didn't mean it. You know I didn't. | Sorry. That was too far.

rule r7_close_jest_stung_warm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=stung self.warmth=warm
does ack
say Oh, #pet#. I'm sorry. I'm an ass. | Forgive me. My mouth runs ahead of my sense. | That was cruel of me. Let me buy you #drink#.
regard other: affinity +1

rule r7_close_jest_stung_cold
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=stung self.warmth=cold
does ack
say Can't take a joke. That's your trouble. | Please yourself. | Touchy.
regard other: affinity -1

rule r7_close_jest_stung_short
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=stung self.temper=short
does ack
say Suit yourself. | Don't growl at me. I was being friendly. | Oh, bite me, then.

rule r7_close_jest_worried
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=worried
does ack
say No, no. I'm teasing. You look fine. Truly. | Gods, don't fret. It's a joke. | Nobody says that. I made it up. Breathe.

rule r7_close_jest_flat
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=flat
does ack
say Tough crowd. | I'll save it for someone who laughs. | Fine. I'll laugh for both of us.

rule r7_close_jest_flat_merry
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=flat self.humour=merry
does ack
say Ha! Ha. Ha... no? Nothing? | You'll laugh at that tonight, in bed, and you'll think of me. | One day I'll make you laugh. One day.

rule r7_close_jest_tired
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=tired
does ack
say Go home. Sleep. I'll tease you properly tomorrow. | You do look done in. Sit down a minute. | All right. I'll save it.

rule r7_close_jest_grief
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jest conv.went=grief
does ack
say Gods. I'm sorry. I didn't think. | Of course. Forgive me. I wasn't thinking. | I'm a fool. Come on, I'll walk with you.
regard other: affinity +1

# ================================================================== Wagers (talk.friends -> wager.answer -> close; settled later)
# The stakes vary (a penny, two, a round), so the answers never name the sum.

rule r7_wager_any
when concept=talk.friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=wager} A penny says the next cart through the gate has a lame mule. | {thread=wager} Two pennies says I can stand on one leg longer than you. | {thread=wager} Bet you a penny you can't name all four Houses without counting on your claws. | {thread=wager} A penny says the next wolf round that corner's wearing a hat.
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_quirk
when concept=talk.friends|talk.smalltalk self.quirk=cannot_resist_a_wager
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 1d
say {thread=wager} Name a thing. Anything. I'll bet on it. | {thread=wager} Two pennies says you sneeze before I do. | {thread=wager} A penny says that pigeon goes left. Left! Quick, take it or leave it.
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_weather
when concept=talk.friends here.weather=overcast|fog
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=wager} A penny says it rains before supper. | {thread=wager} Rain by dusk. I'll put a penny on it. | {thread=wager} Two pennies says this clears by noon. Don't look at the sky, that's cheating.
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_sly
when concept=talk.friends self.honesty=sly
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=wager} Fancy a little wager? Very little. Easy money, for you. | {thread=wager} Bet you can't guess what's in my pocket. Three tries, two pennies. | {thread=wager} I'll wager you a penny I can make you laugh before I count ten. One...
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_tavern
when concept=talk.friends here.place=tavern
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=wager} A jar says I can drink this faster than you. | {thread=wager} Bet you a round I can name every wolf in this room. | {thread=wager} A penny says the next one through that door orders cider.
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_market
when concept=talk.friends here.day=market
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=wager} A penny says the cheese stall sells out before noon. | {thread=wager} Two pennies says the fish stall's lost its voice by midday. | {thread=wager} I'll bet you a penny somebody's pig gets loose today. Somebody's always does.
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_festival
when concept=talk.friends world.festival=today|soon
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=wager} Two pennies says I eat more than you at the feast. | {thread=wager} A penny says I'm dancing before you are. | {thread=wager} A penny says the priest's blessing runs past noon. It always does.
then other: wager.answer

rule r7_wager_guard
when concept=talk.friends self.role=guard
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=wager} A penny says there's a brawl at the tavern before the lamps are lit. | {thread=wager} Two pennies says that cutpurse is back by market day. | {thread=wager} A penny says the captain finds something wrong with my boots tomorrow. Anything. He always does.
then other: wager.answer

## Taking it, or not (self is the one asked)

rule r7_wager_take
when concept=wager.answer
does accept
say {went=taken} #bc_go_on_then# | {went=taken} You're on. | {went=taken} Done. And I'll be watching you. | {went=taken} Fine. Easiest money I'll ever make.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_poor
when concept=wager.answer self.wealth=poor|destitute
does accept
say {went=refused} With what? I've not a penny to my name. | {went=refused} I can't lose. I've nothing to lose with. | {went=refused} Wager me a crust and we'll talk.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_owes
when concept=wager.answer self.owes=yes
does accept
priority 1
say {went=refused} Better not. I owe enough as it is. | {went=refused} If I won, I'd only have to hand it on. No.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_devout
when concept=wager.answer self.piety=devout
does accept
say {went=taken} The priest says wagering's a sin. ...How much? | {went=taken} I shouldn't. I really shouldn't. Go on. | {went=taken} The Bright One frowns on it. The Bright One is busy. Done.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_devout_frank
when concept=wager.answer self.piety=devout self.honesty=frank
does accept
say {went=refused} No. I don't wager. You know that. | {went=refused} Ask me that on Restday and see what I say. No.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_sly_answer
when concept=wager.answer self.honesty=sly
does accept
say {went=raised} Double it and you're on. | {went=raised} Done. But I choose who judges. | {went=raised} Done. And if you lose, you don't tell anyone.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_ambitious
when concept=wager.answer self.drive=ambitious
does accept
say {went=raised} Five times that, or don't waste my time. | {went=raised} Pennies? Make it worth the winning. | {went=raised} Ten times that. I like a wager with teeth.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_rich
when concept=wager.answer self.wealth=rich
does accept
say {went=raised} That? Make it ten times that. I could do with the laugh. | {went=raised} Only if it's worth my while. Raise it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_nervy
when concept=wager.answer self.temper=nervy
does accept
say {went=taken} What if I lose? No. Yes. No. Oh, fine, yes. | {went=taken} I always lose. Why do I always say yes? Yes.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_dry
when concept=wager.answer self.humour=dry
does accept
say {went=taken} I'd sooner bet on the sun coming up. Done, though. | {went=taken} You've lost every wager you ever made me. Fine. | {went=taken} Pay me now and save us both the walk.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_cold
when concept=wager.answer self.warmth=cold
does accept
say {went=refused} No. | {went=refused} I don't play games. | {went=refused} Find someone else to fleece.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_content
when concept=wager.answer self.drive=content
does accept
say {went=refused} What would I do with your money? No, I'm happy as I am. | {went=refused} Let the pennies sit where they are. I'll watch.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_merry
when concept=wager.answer self.humour=merry
does accept
say {went=taken} Ha! Done, and done again! | {went=taken} You're on, and you're buying the cider when you lose. | {went=taken} Done! Oh, I like this. I like this a lot.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_wager_quirk_answer
when concept=wager.answer self.quirk=cannot_resist_a_wager
does accept
priority 1
say {went=taken} Done! Before you've finished asking. | {went=taken} Done. Double it. Triple it. No, double.
then other: reply.close

## Shaking on it (self is the one who offered)

rule r7_close_wager
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=wager
does ack
say Done, then. | #bc_right# | #bc_we_will_see#

rule r7_close_wager_taken
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=wager conv.went=taken
does ack
say Paws on it, then. | Shake. And no backing out. | Remember you said that. I will.
remember pair: wager_on 3d

rule r7_close_wager_raised
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=wager conv.went=raised
does ack
say Oh, now it's serious. Fine. Done. | Steep. But I like my chances. Done. | You'll weep when you pay me. Done.
remember pair: wager_on 3d

rule r7_close_wager_raised_poor
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=wager conv.went=raised self.wealth=poor|destitute
does ack
say Steady on. I said pennies, not a fortune. Forget it. | Some of us live on pennies. Forget I asked.

rule r7_close_wager_refused
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=wager conv.went=refused
does ack
say Coward. | Suit yourself. I'd have won anyway. | More for me, then. In a manner of speaking.

rule r7_close_wager_refused_warm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=wager conv.went=refused self.warmth=warm
does ack
say Never mind. It was only for the fun of it. | No matter. I'll bet on you instead, one day.

## Settling it, a day or two later (whoever brings it up says they won)

rule r7_wager_settle
when concept=talk.friends|talk.smalltalk pair.mem.wager_on=yes
does tell.boast
priority 1
say {thread=settle} About that wager. I won. Pay up. | {thread=settle} Our bet. You lost. I'll have my winnings now. | {thread=settle} You'll have heard. I won. Don't pull that face.
remember pair: wager_on=done 3d
then other: wager.pay

rule r7_pay_plain
when concept=wager.pay
does concede
say {went=paid} Fine. Here. Don't spend it all at once. | {went=paid} Take it. Take it! Gloating doesn't suit you. | {went=paid} Here. And I want a rematch.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_pay_sly
when concept=wager.pay self.honesty=sly
does concede
say {went=disputed} Won? Says who? I never agreed to the terms. | {went=disputed} Double or nothing? | {went=disputed} Funny, I remember it differently. Quite differently.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_pay_poor
when concept=wager.pay self.wealth=poor|destitute
does concede ask.detail
say {went=begged} Can I owe you? Till the month's out? | {went=begged} I've nothing on me. Truly. Look. Lint. | {went=begged} Will you take half a loaf?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_pay_merry
when concept=wager.pay self.humour=merry
does concede
say {went=paid} Ha! Worth it to see you this pleased. | {went=paid} Here. Buy yourself something you'll regret.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_pay_short
when concept=wager.pay self.temper=short
does concede
say {went=paid} You cheated. I know you did. Here. | {went=paid} Take it and don't say another word.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_pay_frank
when concept=wager.pay self.honesty=frank
does concede
say {went=paid} Fair's fair. You won. Here. | {went=paid} You won it square. Here you are.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_close_settle
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=settle
does ack
say Hm. | We'll call it square. | Next time, then.

rule r7_close_settle_paid
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=settle conv.went=paid
does ack
say Pleasure doing business. | I'll buy you a jar with it. That's how good I am. | Ah. It's warm. You've been clutching it.

rule r7_close_settle_disputed
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=settle conv.went=disputed
does ack
say You snake. | I'll remember this. And so will the whole tavern. | Fine. Keep it. Choke on it.

rule r7_close_settle_begged
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=settle conv.went=begged
does ack
say Keep it. Buy yourself a bun. | Ach. Pay me when you're flush. | Forget it. Winning was the best part.

# ================================================================== Confidences (talk.friends -> confide.answer -> close)
# cf: small (a daft secret), trouble (a worry), grief (a sorrow), hope (a wish or a plan), secret (about someone else).

rule r7_confide_any
when concept=talk.friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=confide cf=small} Can I tell you something daft? I'm frightened of moths. Grown wolf. Moths. | {thread=confide cf=small} Promise you won't laugh? I still can't tell left from right. I have to think which paw I eat with. | {thread=confide cf=small} I talk to my cooking pot. Out loud. Most nights. | {thread=confide cf=small} I sleep with a lamp lit. Like a pup. Don't you dare tell anyone.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_owes
when concept=talk.friends self.owes=yes pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} Can I tell you something? I'm in debt. Badly. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I borrowed where I shouldn't have. Don't look at me like that. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} If anyone asks, I'm good for it. I'm not good for it.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_leave
when concept=talk.friends self.drive=restless
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=hope} I've been thinking of leaving. For good. Don't tell anyone. | {thread=confide cf=hope} Some mornings I look at the road out of town and nearly walk it. | {thread=confide cf=hope} I've a mind to go somewhere nobody knows my name. Just to see.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_shop
when concept=talk.friends self.drive=ambitious self.business=none|steady
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=hope} I'm going to have a business of my own. Don't laugh. | {thread=confide cf=hope} I've a plan. A real one. I've been putting coin by for two years. | {thread=confide cf=hope} One day they'll know my name in Ridgemere. I mean it.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_love
when concept=talk.friends self.married=no self.stage=adult|adolescent pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=hope} There's someone. I can't say who. Not yet. | {thread=confide cf=hope} I think I'm in love. Don't laugh. I'm serious. | {thread=confide cf=hope} I've walked past the same door every day this week. Like a fool.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_marriage
when concept=talk.friends self.spouse pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} #self.spouse# and I aren't right. Not lately. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I don't think #self.spouse# hears a word I say any more. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} We had words, #self.spouse# and I. Bad ones.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_doubt
when concept=talk.friends self.piety=ordinary pair.band=friends self.honesty=frank
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} I've not been to chapel in a month. Don't tell the priest. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} Do you think the Bright One listens? Truly? Because I've stopped thinking so. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I lit a candle for something. Nothing happened. I don't know why I'm telling you.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_dream
when concept=talk.friends self.piety=devout
does give.opinion
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=hope} I had a dream. I think it meant something. Something good. | {thread=confide cf=hope} Last Restday I felt the Bright One close. Really close. It frightened me. | {thread=confide cf=hope} I think I've been called. To the chapel. Properly.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_fear
when concept=talk.friends self.temper=nervy
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} I can't sleep. I keep thinking something's coming. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} Every noise at night, I'm sure it's someone at the door. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I've had a feeling all week. A bad one.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_failing
when concept=talk.friends self.business=failing pair.band=friends
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} If the business goes, I don't know what I am. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I've not told anyone. The till's been empty for days. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I lie awake doing sums. They never come out.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_old
when concept=talk.friends self.stage=old
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=grief} I'm forgetting things. Names. Yesterday I forgot the way home. | {thread=confide cf=grief} I don't think I've many winters left. I can feel it. | {thread=confide cf=grief} I've started giving things away. Don't make a fuss.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_apprentice
when concept=talk.friends self.apprentice=yes pair.band!=apprentice
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} I don't think I'm any good at it. The trade. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} My master sighs every time I pick up a tool. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} What if I'm only ever going to be the one who sweeps?
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_sly
when concept=talk.friends self.honesty=sly
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=secret} I know something about someone. Something big. | {thread=confide cf=secret} Can you keep a secret? Good. So can I. Mostly. | {thread=confide cf=secret} I saw something last night I wasn't meant to see.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_accent
when concept=talk.friends self.accent=broad here.region=ridgemere self.from!=ridgemere
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=trouble} Folk here still look at me funny when I open my mouth. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I dreamt of home again. I could smell it. | {thread=confide cf=trouble} I've been trying to talk like the city. It won't come.
then other: confide.answer

rule r7_confide_widowed
when concept=talk.friends self.widowed=yes pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=confide cf=grief} I still reach for their coat on the peg, some mornings. | {thread=confide cf=grief} I sleep with the shutter open, the way they liked it. I hate the cold. I can't shut it. | {thread=confide cf=grief} Everyone stopped asking how I am. I'm not better. They just stopped asking.
then other: confide.answer

## Hearing it (self is the one told). Keyed by what kind of thing was told; a trait without a kind fits them all.

rule r7_confide_heard
when concept=confide.answer
does keep_confidence
say {went=heard} Your secret's safe with me. | {went=heard} I'd not tell a soul. | {went=heard} Thank you for telling me.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_heard_small
when concept=confide.answer conv.cf=small
does keep_confidence
say {went=heard} Is that all? Your secret's safe with me. | {went=heard} I'll take it to my grave. Laughing, but to my grave. | {went=heard} Everyone's got one of those. Mine's worse.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_heard_trouble
when concept=confide.answer conv.cf=trouble
does keep_confidence ask.plan
say {went=heard} That's a lot to carry about on your own. | {went=heard} I'd not tell a soul. What will you do? | {went=heard} How long have you been sitting on that?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_heard_grief
when concept=confide.answer conv.cf=grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} Oh, #pet#. | {went=held} Sit down a minute. Sit with me. | {went=held} I'm glad you told me. I am.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_heard_hope
when concept=confide.answer conv.cf=hope
does keep_confidence
say {went=heard} Well! Look at you. | {went=heard} I'd not tell a soul. But I'm glad you told me. | {went=heard} And about time, too.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_heard_secret
when concept=confide.answer conv.cf=secret
does keep_confidence ask.detail
say {went=heard} Do I want to know? | {went=heard} Go on, then. Who? | {went=heard} Should you be telling me this?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_warm
when concept=confide.answer self.warmth=warm conv.cf=trouble|grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} Come here. Whatever it is, we'll manage it together. | {went=held} Oh, #pet#. Why didn't you say sooner? | {went=held} You can always tell me. Always. Day or night.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_warm_glad
when concept=confide.answer self.warmth=warm conv.cf=small|hope
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} Oh, I'm so glad you told me. | {went=held} Ha! Come here, you. | {went=held} That's the best thing I've heard all week. I mean it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_frank
when concept=confide.answer self.honesty=frank conv.cf=trouble
does keep_confidence
say {went=told} Want the truth? You're making too much of it. | {went=told} Then do something about it. Sitting on it helps no one. | {went=told} You know what I'm going to say. So I'll say it. Stop worrying and act.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_frank_hope
when concept=confide.answer self.honesty=frank conv.cf=hope|small
does keep_confidence
say {went=told} Then do it. Or stop talking about it. | {went=told} That's not a secret. Everyone can see it on you. | {went=told} Good. Don't wait for anyone's leave.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_sly_answer
when concept=confide.answer self.honesty=sly conv.cf=small|trouble|hope
does keep_confidence
say {went=sly} Mm. Safe with me. Quite safe. | {went=sly} Interesting. Very interesting. | {went=sly} I'll keep that. Somewhere safe.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_sly_secret
when concept=confide.answer self.honesty=sly conv.cf=secret
does keep_confidence ask.detail
say {went=sly} Oh? And who else knows? | {went=sly} Tell me everything. I'll know what to do with it. | {went=sly} Ooh. Is it who I think it is?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_cold
when concept=confide.answer self.warmth=cold conv.cf!=grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=cold} Why are you telling me? | {went=cold} That's your business, not mine. | {went=cold} I'd keep that to myself, if I were you.
regard other: trust -1
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_cold_grief
when concept=confide.answer self.warmth=cold conv.cf=grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=awkward} I'm no good at this. I'm sorry. | {went=awkward} ...I don't know what to say. I never do. | {went=awkward} Hm. That's hard. That's hard.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_chatty
when concept=confide.answer self.talk=chatty conv.cf!=grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=heard} I won't breathe a word. Well. I'll try very hard. | {went=heard} Oh! Tell me everything. From the start. | {went=heard} I'm a vault, me. A locked chest. Go on, more.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_quiet
when concept=confide.answer self.talk=quiet
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} Mm. Go on. | {went=held} ...I'm here. | {went=held} *leans closer, says nothing, listens*
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_devout
when concept=confide.answer self.piety=devout conv.cf=trouble|grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} Have you prayed on it? The Bright One's a good listener. | {went=held} Light a candle and sit with it a while. It helps. | {went=held} You're not alone. You never are.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_devout_hope
when concept=confide.answer self.piety=devout conv.cf=hope
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} The Bright One's paw is in it, I'd say. | {went=held} I'll pray it comes right for you. | {went=held} Then it's meant. I can feel it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_merry
when concept=confide.answer self.humour=merry conv.cf=small
does keep_confidence
say {went=light} Is that all? I thought you'd set the town on fire. | {went=light} Ha! You had me worried. That's nothing. | {went=light} Oh, is that it? Have a drink and it'll look smaller.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_merry_hope
when concept=confide.answer self.humour=merry conv.cf=hope
does keep_confidence
say {went=light} Ha! I knew it! I knew it! | {went=light} Oh, this is the best news. Who else knows? Nobody? Even better. | {went=light} About time something good happened to you.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_nervy
when concept=confide.answer self.temper=nervy conv.cf=trouble|secret
does keep_confidence ask.plan
say {went=worried} Oh no. Oh, that's... What will you do? | {went=worried} Don't. Now I'll not sleep either. | {went=worried} Are you sure? Are you sure sure?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_old_answer
when concept=confide.answer self.stage=old conv.cf=trouble|grief
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} I've lived long enough to see worse mended. | {went=held} When you're my age you'll laugh at this. Or cry. One of the two. | {went=held} Sit by me. I've a story about that.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_old_hope
when concept=confide.answer self.stage=old conv.cf=hope|small
does keep_confidence
say {went=held} When I was your age I did the same. Best thing I ever did. | {went=held} At my age you stop minding what folk know. You'll get there. | {went=held} Ha. You remind me of me.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_dry
when concept=confide.answer self.humour=dry conv.cf=small|trouble
does keep_confidence
say {went=light} Well. It could be worse. I can't think how, but it could. | {went=light} I'll add it to the list of things I don't know. | {went=light} Is that the worst of it? I've had worse breakfasts.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_confide_guarded
when concept=confide.answer self.honesty=guarded conv.cf=trouble|secret|hope
does keep_confidence
say {went=told} Some things are best kept close. Keep this one close. | {went=told} Don't tell anyone else. Not anyone. | {went=told} Careful who else hears that.
then other: reply.close

## And then (self is the one who confided)

rule r7_close_confide
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide
does ack
say Thank you. I needed to say it to someone. | Don't tell anyone. | I feel better. A bit.

rule r7_close_confide_heard
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=heard
does ack
say Thank you. I needed to say it to someone. | I knew I could tell you. | I feel better. A bit. | That's a weight off.

rule r7_close_confide_secret
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.cf=secret
does ack
priority 1
say Not here. Later, somewhere quiet. | You'll know soon enough. Everyone will. | Later. When there's fewer ears about.

rule r7_close_confide_nervy
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide self.temper=nervy
does ack
say You won't tell? Promise me. | Swear it. On something. On your mother. | I shouldn't have said. Forget it. Can you forget it?

rule r7_close_confide_held
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=held
does ack
say You're a good friend. The best. | I don't know what I'd do without you. | Thank you. Truly.
regard self: trust +1

rule r7_close_confide_told
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=told
does ack
say Maybe you're right. Maybe. | Easy for you to say. | I know. I know. I just needed someone to say it.

rule r7_close_confide_sly
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=sly
does ack
say ...Forget I said anything. | That's not why I told you. | Why are you smiling like that?

rule r7_close_confide_cold
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=cold
does ack
say Forget it. I don't know why I bothered. | Right. Well. | I thought you'd understand. My mistake.

rule r7_close_confide_awkward
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=awkward
does ack
say No. It's all right. You listened. | You don't have to say anything. | It helps, just saying it out loud.

rule r7_close_confide_light
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=light
does ack
say It's not nothing to me. | Ha. Maybe you're right. Maybe it isn't. | Trust you to make me laugh about it.

rule r7_close_confide_worried
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=confide conv.went=worried
does ack
say Now you're frightening me. | Don't fret. It'll come right. I hope. | Look at us. A pair of frightened pups.

# ================================================================== Plans for later (talk.friends -> plan.answer -> close)
# plankind: evening (a drink, supper, a walk, a fire), day (a Restday, the festival, the lake), chapel, game (dice),
# vague (some time soon).

rule r7_plan_any
when concept=talk.friends pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=plan plankind=vague} We should do something. Soon. | {thread=plan plankind=vague} When are we going to have a proper evening, you and me? | {thread=plan plankind=vague} Come by mine sometime. I mean it, this time. | {thread=plan plankind=vague} Let's not let it be another month.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_tavern
when concept=talk.friends here.time=dusk|night pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=plan plankind=evening} Tavern, after? | {thread=plan plankind=evening} One jar. Just the one. Like always. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} I'll stand you #drink# if you'll sit with me a while. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} The usual place, or wherever's warmest?
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_supper
when concept=talk.friends self.warmth=warm self.wealth!=destitute pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=plan plankind=evening} Come to supper tonight. There's plenty. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} I've a pot of stew that wants eating. Come by. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} You're eating with me tonight. I've decided.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_supper_spouse
when concept=talk.friends self.spouse self.warmth=warm pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=plan plankind=evening} Come and eat with us. #self.spouse# keeps asking after you. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} #self.spouse#'s baking. Come and help us eat it.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_walk
when concept=talk.friends here.season=summer|spring here.weather=clear here.time=day|dusk pair.band=friends
does tell.memory
cooldown 2d
say {thread=plan plankind=evening} Walk out past the gate after? Too fine an evening to waste. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} Let's go up the hill and watch the sun go down. Like we used to. | {thread=plan plankind=evening} Fancy a walk round the walls tonight?
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_restday
when concept=talk.friends here.day=work pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=plan plankind=day} Restday, you and me, doing nothing at all. Agreed? | {thread=plan plankind=day} Come Restday, I'm sleeping till noon, then you're buying me breakfast. | {thread=plan plankind=day} This Restday let's walk out past the fields. Take bread.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_festival
when concept=talk.friends world.festival=soon
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=plan plankind=day} The festival. We're going together, and you're dancing. I've decided. | {thread=plan plankind=day} Save me a place by the fire at the festival. | {thread=plan plankind=day} What are you wearing to the festival? Not that. Anything but that.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_dice
when concept=talk.friends self.honesty=sly here.time=dusk|night
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=plan plankind=game} Bones at the back of the tavern tonight. Bring coin. | {thread=plan plankind=game} There's a game on tonight. Quiet one. You in?
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_chapel
when concept=talk.friends self.piety=devout other.piety=ordinary here.day!=rest
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=plan plankind=chapel} Come to chapel with me on Restday. Just the once. For me. | {thread=plan plankind=chapel} Sit with me at chapel this Restday? The singing's lovely.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_lake
when concept=talk.friends here.region=coldwater pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 3d
say {thread=plan plankind=day} Out on the lake at dawn? I'll bring the bread. | {thread=plan plankind=day} Come out in the boat on Restday. We'll catch nothing and like it.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_snow
when concept=talk.friends here.weather=snow pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=plan plankind=evening} Fire, cider, and not a step outside till spring. My place? | {thread=plan plankind=evening} Come and sit by my fire tonight. I've wood enough for two.
then other: plan.answer

rule r7_plan_kept
when concept=talk.friends pair.mem.planned=yes
does ask.detail
priority 1
once per other
say {thread=plan plankind=vague} Still on for what we said? Don't you back out on me. | {thread=plan plankind=vague} You've not forgotten, have you? Our plan? | {thread=plan plankind=vague} I'm looking forward to it, you know. What we said.
then other: plan.answer

## Yes, no, or maybe (self is the one asked)

rule r7_plan_yes
when concept=plan.answer
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} Aye, go on. | {went=yes} Why not? | {went=yes} I'd like that. | {went=yes} You've talked me into it. It didn't take much.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_tired
when concept=plan.answer self.tired=yes
does accept_invite
say {went=maybe} Ask me when I can stand. | {went=maybe} If I'm awake, I'm there. Don't count on it. | {went=maybe} Gods, I'd fall asleep in the soup.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_working
when concept=plan.answer self.working=yes self.shift=during conv.plankind=evening|game
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} I'm at it till dark. After? | {went=yes} Once I'm done here. If I'm ever done here.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_poor
when concept=plan.answer self.wealth=poor|destitute conv.plankind=evening|game|vague
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} If you're paying. | {went=yes} I'd love to. I've no coin, mind. | {went=yes} Count me in, so long as it's free.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_devout_evening
when concept=plan.answer self.piety=devout conv.plankind=evening
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} Not too late, mind. Chapel in the morning. | {went=yes} Yes, but I'll say grace, and you'll all sit through it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_devout_game
when concept=plan.answer self.piety=devout conv.plankind=game
does accept_invite
say {went=no} Dice? You know I don't. | {went=no} Not dice. Ask me to anything else. | {went=no} I'll not gamble. Not even quietly.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_spouse
when concept=plan.answer self.spouse
does accept_invite
say {went=maybe} I'll ask #self.spouse#. Or tell, rather. | {went=maybe} #self.spouse# will want to come. Is that all right? | {went=maybe} If #self.spouse# lets me off the lead.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_parent
when concept=plan.answer self.child conv.plankind=evening|game
does accept_invite
say {went=maybe} If someone can watch #self.child#. | {went=maybe} Bring #self.child#? No. Gods, no. I'll find someone.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_ambitious
when concept=plan.answer self.drive=ambitious
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} Can't. Work. ...Fine. One hour. | {went=yes} I've ledgers. I've always got ledgers. All right. Briefly.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_nervy_evening
when concept=plan.answer self.temper=nervy conv.plankind=evening|game
does accept_invite
say {went=maybe} After dark? You know I don't like the streets after dark. | {went=maybe} Will you walk me home after? Then yes.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_merry
when concept=plan.answer self.humour=merry
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} When have I ever said no? | {went=yes} Try and stop me. | {went=yes} I'll be there before you are. I'll be there now. Let's go now.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_quiet
when concept=plan.answer self.talk=quiet
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} Mm. Yes. | {went=yes} ...I'd like that. | {went=yes} I'll come.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_cold
when concept=plan.answer self.warmth=cold
does accept_invite
say {went=maybe} Perhaps. | {went=maybe} #bc_we_will_see# | {went=maybe} If I've nothing better.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_hurt
when concept=plan.answer self.injured=bad
does accept_invite
say {went=no} On these legs? You'll have to carry me. | {went=no} Not till I can walk without wincing.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_mourning
when concept=plan.answer self.mourning=kin|friend
does accept_invite
priority 3
say {went=no} Not yet. Ask me again in a few days. | {went=no} I can't. Not with things as they are. | {went=no} Thank you. But no. Not yet.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_content
when concept=plan.answer self.drive=content
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} That sounds just right. | {went=yes} Lovely. Nothing better. | {went=yes} Yes. Exactly what I wanted, and I didn't know it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_restless
when concept=plan.answer self.drive=restless
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} Anything to get out of these four walls. Yes. | {went=yes} Yes! Somewhere. Anywhere. Yes.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_short
when concept=plan.answer self.temper=short
does accept_invite
say {went=maybe} Not tonight. | {went=maybe} I'll see how I feel. | {went=maybe} Don't nag. I'll come if I come.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_sly
when concept=plan.answer self.honesty=sly
does accept_invite
say {went=yes} What's in it for me? ...Fine. | {went=yes} Who else is coming? ...Then yes.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_chapel_answer
when concept=plan.answer conv.plankind=chapel
does accept_invite
priority 1
say {went=yes} Chapel? Me? ...Oh, all right. For you. | {went=yes} If the roof doesn't fall in when I walk through the door. | {went=yes} Only if we sit at the back. Right at the back.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_plan_chapel_no
when concept=plan.answer conv.plankind=chapel self.warmth=cold|reserved self.honesty=frank|sly
does accept_invite
priority 1
say {went=no} No. You go. Pray for me if you must. | {went=no} The Bright One and I have an arrangement. I stay away; nobody's embarrassed. | {went=no} Not this Restday. Nor the next.
then other: reply.close

## Settled (self is the one who asked)

rule r7_close_plan
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=plan
does ack
say #bc_good# | Right, then. | We'll see, then.

rule r7_close_plan_yes
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=plan conv.went=yes
does ack
say Good. I'll knock. | That's settled, then. | Don't you dare forget. | Good! I'll hold you to it.
remember pair: planned 2d

rule r7_close_plan_maybe
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=plan conv.went=maybe
does ack
say Try. For me. | I'll take a maybe. | A maybe's a yes with its boots off.

rule r7_close_plan_no
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=plan conv.went=no
does ack
say Another time, then. | Fair enough. Mind yourself. | I'll ask again. I always do.

rule r7_close_plan_no_warm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=plan conv.went=no self.warmth=warm
does ack
say Then I'll bring the supper to you. | Then I'll come and sit with you instead. No arguments.

rule r7_close_plan_no_short
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=plan conv.went=no self.temper=short
does ack
say Suit yourself. | Fine. I'll ask someone who wants to come.

# ================================================================== Remember when (talk.friends -> recall.answer -> close)
# rc: caper (something they got up to), times (how things were).

rule r7_recall_any
when concept=talk.friends pair.band=friends|spouses
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=times} Remember the flood year? | {thread=recall rc=times} Do you ever think about how we met? | {thread=recall rc=times} Remember when you were going to be a sailor? | {thread=recall rc=times} Remember that winter we had nothing but turnips? For a month?
then other: recall.answer

rule r7_recall_pups
when concept=talk.friends pair.band=friends self.stage=adult|old other.stage=adult|old
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember when we were pups and you fell in the millpond? | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember the old miller chasing us with a broom? | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember our first jar? You were sick in a hat. Someone's hat. | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember the raft we built? It sank. At once.
then other: recall.answer

rule r7_recall_old
when concept=talk.friends self.stage=old other.stage=old
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=times} Remember the winter the river froze right to the bottom? | {thread=recall rc=times} Do you remember when this was all fields? | {thread=recall rc=times} Remember the dances, when we could still dance? | {thread=recall rc=times} Remember old Grizzle with the one ear? Gone now, of course.
then other: recall.answer

rule r7_recall_home
when concept=talk.friends pair.same_from=yes self.from!=ridgemere here.region=ridgemere
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=times} Do you remember the smell of home in spring? | {thread=recall rc=times} Remember the bakehouse back home? I'd give a week's pay for one of those loaves. | {thread=recall rc=times} Remember how quiet it was at night, back home? I can't sleep here for the noise.
then other: recall.answer

rule r7_recall_tavern
when concept=talk.friends here.place=tavern pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember the night we sang every verse of the Ford song? Every one? | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember when you challenged the smith to arm-wrestle? | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember when you fell asleep under that very table?
then other: recall.answer

rule r7_recall_festival
when concept=talk.friends world.festival=today|soon pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember last year's festival? You and the greased pole? | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember when you won the race? Fell over at the end, but you won. | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember dancing till the fiddler gave up?
then other: recall.answer

rule r7_recall_snow
when concept=talk.friends here.weather=snow pair.band=friends
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember the snow fight by the well? The Watch joined in. | {thread=recall rc=caper} Remember when we tried to sled down the chapel steps?
then other: recall.answer

## Remembering it, as they are (self is the one reminded)

rule r7_recall_fond
when concept=recall.answer
does react.story
say {went=fond} How could I forget? | {went=fond} Don't. I still dream about it. | {went=fond} Gods, that was a long time ago. | {went=fond} Ha! I'd almost forgotten. Almost.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_merry
when concept=recall.answer self.humour=merry conv.rc=caper
does react.story
say {went=fond} I remember it differently. In mine, I'm a hero. | {went=fond} Ha! And you swore you'd never tell a soul! | {went=fond} Oh, that! I laughed for a week. I'm laughing now.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_merry_times
when concept=recall.answer self.humour=merry conv.rc=times
does react.story
say {went=fond} Oh, don't. I'm smiling already. | {went=fond} We laughed through it, didn't we? Somehow we always laughed. | {went=fond} Ha! I tell that one to everyone. Badly.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_old_answer
when concept=recall.answer self.stage=old
does react.story
say {went=fond} Like yesterday. Clearer than yesterday, if I'm honest. | {went=fond} I remember it better than this morning. | {went=fond} Aye. We were somebody, then.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_cold
when concept=recall.answer self.warmth=cold
does react.story
say {went=vague} Vaguely. | {went=vague} If you say so. | {went=vague} I don't think about all that.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_dry
when concept=recall.answer self.humour=dry
does react.story
say {went=fond} I've spent years trying to forget it. Thank you. | {went=fond} Every bit of it. Sadly. | {went=fond} I remember. I'd hoped you didn't.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_short
when concept=recall.answer self.temper=short
does react.story
say {went=sour} I don't want to talk about that. | {went=sour} Leave it. That's past. | {went=sour} Why bring that up?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_warm
when concept=recall.answer self.warmth=warm
does react.story
say {went=fond} Best days. Weren't they? Weren't they just? | {went=fond} Oh, I love that you remember that. | {went=fond} I think about that more than you'd know.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_sly
when concept=recall.answer self.honesty=sly conv.rc=caper
does react.story
say {went=denied} That wasn't me. You can't prove it was me. | {went=denied} I was nowhere near. I have witnesses. Paid ones.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_quiet
when concept=recall.answer self.talk=quiet
does react.story
say {went=fond} *smiles* Aye. | {went=fond} ...I remember. | {went=fond} Mm. Good days.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_frank
when concept=recall.answer self.honesty=frank conv.rc=caper
does react.story
say {went=fond} You were a terrible pup. Truly terrible. | {went=fond} It was your idea, and it was a bad one. | {went=fond} I remember. You cried.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_frank_times
when concept=recall.answer self.honesty=frank conv.rc=times
does react.story
say {went=sour} I remember. It was miserable, and you know it. | {went=sour} Folk talk about those days like they were good. They weren't. | {went=sour} I do. I don't miss it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_nervy
when concept=recall.answer self.temper=nervy
does react.story
say {went=fond} Don't remind me. My heart's still pounding from it. | {went=fond} I still have dreams about that. Bad ones.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_recall_widowed
when concept=recall.answer self.widowed=yes
does react.story
say {went=sad} We were all there then, weren't we? All of us. | {went=sad} I wish my old love could hear you tell it. | {went=sad} We used to tell that one together, the two of us. I've lost half of it now.
then other: reply.close

## Closing it (self is the one who remembered)

rule r7_close_recall
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall
does ack
say Aye. Well. | Those were the days. | Funny, what stays with you.

rule r7_close_recall_fond
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall conv.went=fond
does ack
say Those were the days. | We were idiots. Happy idiots. | I wouldn't change a day of it. | We should do something that stupid again.

rule r7_close_recall_fond_old
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall conv.went=fond self.stage=old
does ack
say We'll not see days like those again. | They don't make winters like that any more. Or wolves.

rule r7_close_recall_sour
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall conv.went=sour
does ack
say Sorry. I didn't mean to stir anything. | No. You're right. Let it lie.

rule r7_close_recall_sad
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall conv.went=sad
does ack
say I'll tell it for both of you, then. Any time you like. | They'd have laughed. I know they would. | I miss them too, you know.

rule r7_close_recall_denied
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall conv.went=denied
does ack
say It was you. Everyone knows it was you. | I was THERE. I watched you do it. | Liar. Lovely liar.

rule r7_close_recall_vague
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=recall conv.went=vague
does ack
say You were there! You were right there! | How can you not remember? I'll never forget it.

# ================================================================== A long time apart (talk.friends -> apart.answer -> close)

rule r7_apart_week
when concept=talk.friends pair.days_since>=7 pair.days_since<14 pair.band=friends
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=apart} Haven't seen you all week. Where've you been? | {thread=apart} There you are! I'd started to think you'd moved. | {thread=apart} A week! Not a word for a week.
then other: apart.answer

rule r7_apart_long
when concept=talk.friends pair.days_since>=14
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=apart} Look who it is! I thought you'd died. | {thread=apart} Where have you been hiding? | {thread=apart} It's been weeks! Weeks! | {thread=apart} There you are. I'd started to worry.
then other: apart.answer

rule r7_apart_very_long
when concept=talk.friends pair.days_since>=40
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=apart} It's been an age. I'd nearly forgotten your face. Nearly. | {thread=apart} Months! Months, and not a word. | {thread=apart} Is it you? It is. Gods, it feels like half a year.
then other: apart.answer

rule r7_apart_warm
when concept=talk.friends pair.days_since>=14 self.warmth=warm
does tease
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=apart} Come here, let me look at you. Oh, I've missed you. | {thread=apart} You! Oh, it's good to see you. Come here.
then other: apart.answer

rule r7_apart_cold
when concept=talk.friends pair.days_since>=14 self.warmth=cold
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=apart} You're back, then. | {thread=apart} Oh. It's you. Been a while.
then other: apart.answer

rule r7_apart_short
when concept=talk.friends pair.days_since>=14 self.temper=short
does tell.self
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=apart} Didn't think to call by, did you? Not once. | {thread=apart} Oh, NOW you've time for me.
then other: apart.answer

## Where they've been (self is the one who was away)

rule r7_apart_plain
when concept=apart.answer
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=sorry} Here and there. Mostly there. | {went=sorry} Busy. Too busy. I'm sorry. | {went=sorry} I know, I know. | {went=sorry} Has it been that long? It has, hasn't it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_travelling
when concept=apart.answer self.travelling=yes
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=road} On the road. I've seen half the realm, and it's all mud. | {went=road} Away. Every inn between here and the hills knows my snore.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_mourning
when concept=apart.answer self.mourning=kin|friend
does answer.whereabouts
priority 2
say {went=hard} It's been a hard few weeks. | {went=hard} We lost someone. I couldn't face anyone.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_hurt
when concept=apart.answer self.injured=light|bad
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=hard} Laid up. Don't ask. | {went=hard} Took a knock. Spent a while flat on my back.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_quiet
when concept=apart.answer self.talk=quiet
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=vague} Around. | {went=vague} ...Busy. | {went=vague} Here. Just not out.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_sly
when concept=apart.answer self.honesty=sly
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=vague} Oh, you know. Nowhere you'd want to hear about. | {went=vague} Here and there. Mostly where I shouldn't be.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_warm_answer
when concept=apart.answer self.warmth=warm
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=sorry} I know. I'm sorry. I thought of you every day. | {went=sorry} I missed you too. More than you'd think.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_poor
when concept=apart.answer self.wealth=poor|destitute
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=hard} Keeping my head down. Things have been thin. | {went=hard} Working every hour there is. And some there aren't.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_working
when concept=apart.answer self.drive=ambitious
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=sorry} Making something of myself. You'll see. | {went=sorry} Work. Nothing but work. It's paying, at least.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_spouse
when concept=apart.answer self.spouse
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=sorry} #self.spouse# has kept me busy. | {went=sorry} Home, mostly. #self.spouse# and I have had a lot on.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_apart_devout
when concept=apart.answer self.piety=devout
does answer.whereabouts
say {went=sorry} In chapel, mostly. Praying. For you, sometimes. | {went=sorry} Keeping the Bright One company. I don't think my snoring's minded.
then other: reply.close

## Glad to have them back (self is the one who stayed)

rule r7_close_apart
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=apart
does ack
say Well, you're here now. | Hm. Good to see you. | Don't leave it so long.

rule r7_close_apart_sorry
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=apart conv.went=sorry
does ack
say Well, you're here now. That's what matters. | Don't leave it so long next time. | You owe me a whole month of talk. Start now.

rule r7_close_apart_road
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=apart conv.went=road
does ack
say You'll have stories, then. Sit. Tell me. | Did you bring me anything? No? Stories, then.

rule r7_close_apart_hard
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=apart conv.went=hard
does ack
say Oh. Why didn't you send word? | You should have come to me. You know that. | I'd have come. You only had to ask.

rule r7_close_apart_vague
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=apart conv.went=vague
does ack
say Keep your secrets, then. | Hm. I'll get it out of you over a jar.

rule r7_close_apart_cold
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=apart self.warmth=cold
does ack
say Hm. Well. | #bc_right#

# ================================================================== Grudges (talk.quarrel -> jibe.answer -> close)
# The opener is the one who likes the other least (World::ambientTopic), so pair.affinity, trust, respect and fear are
# the opener's feelings, and pair.owed=b means the answerer owes the opener.
# jb: insult (a sneer), accuse (a charge: thieving, lying, hitting, undercutting, the noise), dun (where's my money),
# debt (the opener owes, and knows it).

rule r7_jibe_any
when concept=talk.quarrel
does challenge
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Oh. It's you. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Don't you have somewhere else to be? | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Every time I turn round, there you are. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Of all the wolves in this town. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} You're standing in my light. You're always standing in my light.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_short
when concept=talk.quarrel self.temper=short
does challenge
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} You've got a nerve, showing your muzzle round here. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Look at me like that again. Go on. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Move. Before I move you. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} What are you staring at, #insult#?
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_dry
when concept=talk.quarrel self.humour=dry
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Oh, it's you. And the day was going so well. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} I'd say it's nice to see you, but I was raised not to lie. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Ah. The smell makes sense now.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_frank
when concept=talk.quarrel self.honesty=frank
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} I'll say it plain: I don't like you, and I don't trust you. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Everyone's too polite to tell you. I'm not. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} You know what you are. I'll not waste breath saying it.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_sly
when concept=talk.quarrel self.honesty=sly
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Heard something interesting about you. Very interesting. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Lovely to see you. Truly. How's your little secret? | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Such a shame, what folk are saying. I defended you. Briefly.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_cold
when concept=talk.quarrel self.warmth=cold
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Don't speak to me. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Go away. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} I've nothing to say to you. Nothing at all.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_nervy
when concept=talk.quarrel self.temper=nervy
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Stay away from me. I mean it. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Don't come any closer. I'll shout for the Watch. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Why are you always where I am?
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_afraid
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.fear>=30
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} I'm not afraid of you. I'm not. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} You don't frighten me. You don't. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Go on, then. Glare. See if I care.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_distrust
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.trust<=-40
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=accuse} I know you were in my things. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} I count my coin twice when you're near. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Liar. Everything you say. Liar.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_scorn
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.respect<=-30
does tell.complaint
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Everyone knows you're useless. Everyone. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Done anything useful today? No. Thought not. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} A pup of six does better work than you.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_grudging_respect
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.respect>=30
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} I'll say this once: you're good at what you do. I still can't stand you. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} You'd be easier to hate if you weren't so good at your work.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_thief
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.rumour=thief
does challenge
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Keep your paws where I can see them. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Lost anything lately? No? Found anything, then? | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Every time you pass, something's missing. Funny, that.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_violent
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.rumour=violent
does challenge
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Going to hit me too? Go on. Everyone knows you do. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Keep your fists in your pockets. I've heard about you. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Who'd you knock down this week, then?
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_promises
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.rumour=breaks_promises
does challenge
priority 1
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Your word's worth less than the breath it's said on. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Promise me something. Go on. I could do with a laugh.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_owed
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.owed=b
does challenge
priority 1
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jibe jb=dun} Where's my money? | {thread=jibe jb=dun} You still owe me, and the whole street knows it. | {thread=jibe jb=dun} I lent you that in good faith. More fool me.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_owing
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.owed=a
does challenge
priority 1
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jibe jb=debt} Don't look at me like that. You'll get your pennies. | {thread=jibe jb=debt} Stop telling folk I owe you. I know I owe you. | {thread=jibe jb=debt} Every time you see me, it's that face. You'll be paid.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_hostile
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.disposition=hostile
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} One day, you and me. One day. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} If you were on fire I'd fetch more wood. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} I hope your roof leaks. On your bed. All winter.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_rich
when concept=talk.quarrel self.wealth=rich other.wealth=poor|destitute
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Shouldn't you be begging somewhere else? | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Your sort brings the whole street down. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Don't touch the coat.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_poor
when concept=talk.quarrel self.wealth=poor|destitute other.wealth=rich
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} All right for some, isn't it? Fat on other folk's work. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Nice boots. Who'd you rob? | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Must be grand, never counting pennies.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_heights
when concept=talk.quarrel self.quarter=sump|commons|works other.quarter=heights here.region=ridgemere
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Lost, are we? The Heights are that way. Up. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Come down to look at the poor folk, have you? | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Mind the gutter. It's where we keep our manners.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_sump
when concept=talk.quarrel self.quarter=heights other.quarter=sump here.region=ridgemere
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Back to the Sump with you. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} I can smell the Sump on you from here. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Did the Sump run out of gutters?
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_trade
when concept=talk.quarrel self.role=merchant other.role=merchant
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Undercutting me again? I saw your prices. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Telling my customers lies about me again? | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Your stall's in my way. Your whole life's in my way.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_young
when concept=talk.quarrel self.stage=old other.stage=adult|adolescent
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} No respect, your generation. None. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} When I was your age, I'd have been whipped for that look. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Mind your manners, pup.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_devout
when concept=talk.quarrel self.piety=devout other.piety=ordinary
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} The Bright One sees what you are, even if this town doesn't. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} I'll pray for you. Somebody has to.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_tavern
when concept=talk.quarrel here.place=tavern here.time=night
does challenge
cooldown 1d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} You've had enough. And so have I, of you. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Another word and you're wearing that cup. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Drink up and get out. You're souring the cider.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_restday
when concept=talk.quarrel here.day=rest
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=insult} Even on Restday you can't leave me be. | {thread=jibe jb=insult} Of course it's you. On Restday. The Bright One's testing me.
then other: jibe.answer

rule r7_jibe_neighbours
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.neighbours=yes
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Your door. Midnight. Again. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} I can hear every word through that wall, you know. Every word. | {thread=jibe jb=accuse} Your rubbish is on my step. Again.
then other: jibe.answer

## Answering it, as they are (self is the one jibed at). Traits fit a sneer or a charge alike; a demand for money,
## or a debtor's excuses, are answered first by what they're about (priority 1).

rule r7_jibe_back
when concept=jibe.answer
does counter
say {went=cool} Likewise. | {went=cool} Get out of my way. | {went=cool} Say what you like. I've heard worse. | {went=cool} And you're still as pleasant as ever.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_back_accused
when concept=jibe.answer conv.jb=accuse
does counter
say {went=cool} I never did. Prove it. | {went=cool} Say that in front of the Watch, then. | {went=cool} Believe what you like. You will anyway.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_short_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.temper=short
does counter
say {went=hot} Say that again. I dare you. | {went=hot} You want to try me? Here? Now? | {went=hot} You'll eat those words. | {went=hot} Come on, then, #insult#.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_calm_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.temper=calm
does counter
say {went=cool} Are you finished? Good. Good day. | {went=cool} If it makes you feel better, say it. | {went=cool} I'm not going to fight you. Not today, not any day.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_nervy_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.temper=nervy
does counter
say {went=cowed} I don't want trouble. I don't. | {went=cowed} Leave me be. Please. | {went=cowed} Why do you always... no. Never mind.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_dry_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.humour=dry
does counter
say {went=wit} Lovely. Did you practise that? | {went=wit} Your wit's as sharp as ever. Which is to say, not. | {went=wit} I'll treasure that. Next to the others.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_merry_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.humour=merry
does counter
say {went=wit} Ha! You'll have to do better than that. | {went=wit} Is that the best you've got? I've been insulted better by my own grandmother. | {went=wit} Ooh. Sharp. I'll need a healer.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_sly_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.honesty=sly
does counter
say {went=hot} Careful. I know things about you too. | {went=hot} Say that louder. I'd like the street to hear what you sound like. | {went=hot} Interesting. I'll remember you said that.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_frank_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.honesty=frank
does counter
say {went=hot} You know your trouble? Everyone's sick of you, and no one will say it. | {went=hot} Fine. I'll say it too. You're a bully. | {went=hot} We both know why you hate me. Shall I say it?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_warm_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.warmth=warm
does counter
say {went=mend} Why are we like this? We could get on, you and me. | {went=mend} I don't want this. I never did. | {went=mend} Can we not? Just for today?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_devout_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.piety=devout
does counter
say {went=cool} The Bright One forgives you. I'm still working on it. | {went=cool} I'll not answer that. Not on my soul.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_cold_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.warmth=cold
does counter
say {went=cool} *turns their back* | {went=cool} Hm. | {went=cool} You're not worth the breath.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_quiet_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.talk=quiet
does counter
say {went=cool} ... | {went=cool} *says nothing, and goes on with what they were doing* | {went=cool} Mm.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_old_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.stage=old
does counter
tone grave
say {went=wit} I've buried better than you, and I'll bury you. | {went=wit} Shout all you like. I'm deaf in that ear. On purpose.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_guard_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.role=guard
does counter
say {went=warned} Careful. You're talking to the Watch. | {went=warned} Say that again and you'll say it in the cells.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_poor_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.wealth=destitute
does counter
say {went=cowed} What do you want? I've nothing left to take. | {went=cowed} Kick me, then. Everyone else does.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_fought_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.fought=yes
does counter
priority 1
say {went=hot} I've had one fight this week. Don't make it two. | {went=hot} I've still got the bruises from the last one who tried that.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_mourning_answer
when concept=jibe.answer self.mourning=kin|friend
does counter
tone grave
priority 3
say {went=cowed} Not today. Whatever this is, not today. | {went=cowed} I've buried someone this week. Have you no shame?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_dunned
when concept=jibe.answer conv.jb=dun
does counter
priority 1
say {went=promised} You'll get it. When I have it. | {went=promised} I said I'd pay and I will. Stop shouting it about. | {went=promised} Keep your voice down, for pity's sake.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_dunned_short
when concept=jibe.answer conv.jb=dun self.temper=short
does counter
priority 1
say {went=hot} Shout it again and you'll wait twice as long. | {went=hot} You'll get your money. Not a day sooner for the shouting.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_dunned_poor
when concept=jibe.answer conv.jb=dun self.wealth=poor|destitute
does counter
priority 1
say {went=cowed} With what? Look at me. With what? | {went=cowed} I've nothing. You can see I've nothing. | {went=cowed} Take my coat, then. It's all I've got.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_pressed
when concept=jibe.answer conv.jb=debt
does counter
priority 1
say {went=pressed} Then pay me, and you'll not see the face. | {went=pressed} When? That's all I ask. When? | {went=pressed} You've said that since spring.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_jibe_pressed_warm
when concept=jibe.answer conv.jb=debt self.warmth=warm
does counter
priority 1
say {went=mend} I'm not chasing you. I'd just like to know when. | {went=mend} Pay me when you can. Only stop glaring at me. | {went=mend} I've not told a soul. Whoever said I did is lying.
then other: reply.close

## And the last word (self is the one who started it)

rule r7_close_jibe
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe
does ack
say Hm. | #bc_we_will_see# | Just stay out of my way.

rule r7_close_jibe_hot
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=hot
does ack
say Any time. Any place. | Try it. Go on. | Not here. But I'll remember. | Big words.

rule r7_close_jibe_hot_short
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=hot self.temper=short
does ack
say Right. Outside. Now. | Come on, then! Come on! | I'll break your muzzle for you.
regard other: fear +1

rule r7_close_jibe_hot_nervy
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=hot self.temper=nervy
does ack
say ...Fine. Fine! I'm going. | Don't you touch me. I'll scream. I will.

rule r7_close_jibe_hot_calm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=hot self.temper=calm
does ack
say Look at you. All teeth. I'm done here. | Shout, then. I've somewhere to be.

rule r7_close_jibe_cool
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=cool
does ack
say Good. Then stay out of my way. | Hm. | Fine. Fine.

rule r7_close_jibe_cowed
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=cowed
does ack
say That's right. Walk away. | Thought so. | Hm. Not so bold now.

rule r7_close_jibe_cowed_warm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=cowed self.warmth=warm
does ack
say ...I didn't mean to frighten you. | Wait. That came out wrong. I'm sorry.
regard other: fear -1

rule r7_close_jibe_warned
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=warned
does ack
say Hiding behind the badge. Typical. | Oh, I'm shaking. | The cells. For talking. Listen to yourself.

rule r7_close_jibe_wit
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=wit
does ack
say Laugh while you can. | Very clever. Clever won't save you. | Hmph. | Think you're funny.

rule r7_close_jibe_mend
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=mend
does ack
say Hm. Ask me again when I'm not so cross. | I don't know. I don't know why we're like this. | ...Maybe. Not today.
remember pair: softened 7d

rule r7_close_jibe_mend_cold
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=mend self.warmth=cold
does ack
say Get on? Ha. | Don't try that with me.

rule r7_close_jibe_promised
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=promised
does ack
say See that you do. | I'll believe it when it's in my paw. | By Restday. Or I go to the Watch.

rule r7_close_jibe_pressed
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=jibe conv.went=pressed
does ack
say Soon. I said soon. | You'll have it. Gods. | I'm working on it, aren't I?

# ================================================================== Making up (talk.quarrel -> mend.answer -> close)

rule r7_mend_any
when concept=talk.quarrel
does challenge
cooldown 3d
say {thread=mend} Look. About before. I'm sorry. | {thread=mend} I'll say sorry if you will. | {thread=mend} This is daft, the two of us. | {thread=mend} How long are we going to keep this up?
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_warm
when concept=talk.quarrel self.warmth=warm
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=mend} Can we stop this? I'm tired of it. | {thread=mend} I was wrong. There. I said it. | {thread=mend} Let me buy you #drink#. We'll call it square.
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_calm
when concept=talk.quarrel self.temper=calm
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=mend} This has gone on long enough. Shall we leave it? | {thread=mend} I've no stomach for a fight. Have you?
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_devout
when concept=talk.quarrel self.piety=devout here.day=rest
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=mend} It's Restday. Peace on Restday, at least. Shall we? | {thread=mend} The priest says not to let the sun go down on it. It's going down.
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_softened
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.mem.softened=yes
does challenge
priority 2
cooldown 1d
say {thread=mend} I've been thinking about what you said. About getting on. | {thread=mend} You were right, the other day. We could get on, if we tried.
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_respect
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.respect>=20
does ask.detail
cooldown 3d
say {thread=mend} I don't like you. But I respect you. Can that be enough? | {thread=mend} You're the best at what you do. I hate that. Truce?
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_festival
when concept=talk.quarrel world.festival=today
does challenge
priority 1
cooldown 1d
say {thread=mend} It's a feast day. Even we can share a table on a feast day. | {thread=mend} Festival. Truce till dawn?
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_mourning
when concept=talk.quarrel other.mourning=kin|friend
does challenge
priority 3
cooldown 2d
say {thread=mend} I heard. I'm sorry. Whatever's between us, I'm sorry. | {thread=mend} I'll not trouble you today. I'm sorry for your loss.
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_old
when concept=talk.quarrel self.stage=old other.stage=old
does challenge
cooldown 2d
say {thread=mend} We're too old for this. Both of us. | {thread=mend} How many winters have we got left? Too few to waste on this.
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_same_from
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.same_from=yes self.from!=ridgemere here.region=ridgemere
does challenge
cooldown 3d
say {thread=mend} We're both a long way from home. We shouldn't be at each other's throats. | {thread=mend} Two of us from back home, and we can't get on. Our mothers would weep.
then other: mend.answer

rule r7_mend_after
when concept=talk.quarrel pair.mem.mended=yes
does ask.detail
priority 2
cooldown 2d
say {thread=mend} We said truce. I'm keeping to it. Are you? | {thread=mend} Still at peace, are we? Good. Hard work, isn't it? | {thread=mend} I've not said a bad word about you all week. It's killing me.
then other: mend.answer

## Taking the paw, or not (self is the one offered peace)

rule r7_mend_maybe
when concept=mend.answer
does accept_apology
say {went=grudging} ...Maybe. | {went=grudging} I'll think about it. | {went=grudging} #bc_we_will_see# | {went=grudging} Perhaps. Don't push it.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_warm_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.warmth=warm
does accept_apology
say {went=yes} Yes. Gods, yes. I've hated this. | {went=yes} I've wanted to say it for weeks. Yes. | {went=yes} Come here, you fool.
regard self: affinity +1
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_short_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.temper=short
does accept_apology
say {went=no} Sorry doesn't mend it. | {went=no} You think it's that easy? | {went=no} No. You don't get to decide when it's over.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_cold_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.warmth=cold
does accept_apology
say {went=no} No. | {went=no} I don't think so. | {went=no} Too late for that.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_calm_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.temper=calm
does accept_apology
say {went=yes} All right. All right. Let's leave it. | {went=yes} Agreed. It's gone on too long. | {went=yes} Yes. Life's short.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_sly_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.honesty=sly
does accept_apology ask.detail
say {went=grudging} And what's it worth to you? | {went=grudging} Peace? Interesting. What do you want?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_frank_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.honesty=frank
does accept_apology
say {went=yes} You were wrong. But so was I. Fine. | {went=yes} I'll be honest, I'm sick of it too. Yes.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_devout_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.piety=devout
does accept_apology
say {went=yes} The Bright One asks it of us. All right. | {went=yes} I've prayed on it. Yes.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_nervy_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.temper=nervy
does accept_apology ask.detail
say {went=grudging} You mean it? You're not... you mean it? | {went=grudging} Is this a trick? It's a trick, isn't it?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_mourning_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.mourning=kin|friend
does accept_apology
priority 3
say {went=yes} Thank you. I... thank you. | {went=yes} That's kind. Kinder than I'd have been.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_merry_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.humour=merry
does accept_apology
say {went=yes} Only if you're buying. | {went=yes} Ha! Fine. But I'm still better looking.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_dry_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.humour=dry
does accept_apology
say {went=grudging} Well. Stranger things have happened. Not many. | {went=grudging} Peace. With you. Let me sit down.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_mend_guarded_answer
when concept=mend.answer self.honesty=guarded
does accept_apology
say {went=grudging} Words are cheap. Show me. | {went=grudging} We'll see how long it lasts.
then other: reply.close

## Then (self is the one who offered)

rule r7_close_mend
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=mend
does ack
say Well. | #bc_right# | That's something.

rule r7_close_mend_yes
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=mend conv.went=yes
does ack
say Good. Good. Shake, then. | That's done, then. Thank the Bright One. | Truce. And this time it sticks.
regard other: affinity +1
remember pair: mended 14d

rule r7_close_mend_grudging
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=mend conv.went=grudging
does ack
say That's more than I hoped for. | Then I'll show you. | It's a start.

rule r7_close_mend_no
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=mend conv.went=no
does ack
say Then rot. | Fine. I tried. Remember I tried. | Your choice. It was always your choice.
regard other: affinity -1

rule r7_close_mend_no_warm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=mend conv.went=no self.warmth=warm
does ack
say I'll ask again. And again. | Then I'll wait. I'm good at waiting.

rule r7_close_mend_no_short
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=mend conv.went=no self.temper=short
does ack
say Fine! Fine. Your loss. | I don't know why I bothered.

# ================================================================== Acquaintances (talk.day / talk.smalltalk -> chat.answer -> close)
# ch: how (how are you, in some form), remark (a passing remark), name (they've lost the other's name), wall (they're
# neighbours), shop (the opener buys from the other), new (the other's new in town), pup (an old wolf to a youngster),
# pry (fishing for gossip).

rule r7_chat_any
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk pair.band=acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=how} Busy day? | {thread=chat ch=how} Keeping out of trouble? | {thread=chat ch=how} Off somewhere nice? | {thread=chat ch=how} Keeping well?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_chatty
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.talk=chatty pair.band=acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=remark} Did you hear the bell this morning? Twice! Twice, and nobody knows why. | {thread=chat ch=remark} You're the one from by the well, aren't you? I never forget a face. Names, yes. Faces, never. | {thread=chat ch=remark} The baker's put the prices up again, did you know? A penny on a loaf. A whole penny!
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_quiet
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.talk=quiet pair.band=acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=how} ...Keeping well? | {thread=chat ch=how} *nods* All right? | {thread=chat ch=how} Mm. Busy, today?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_nervy
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.temper=nervy pair.band=acquaintances|strangers
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=remark} Is it me, or are there more strangers about lately? | {thread=chat ch=remark} The geese have been at it all morning. Have you noticed? | {thread=chat ch=remark} There's a cart been standing at the corner since dawn. Nobody with it.
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_formal
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.tone=formal pair.band=acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=how} I trust the day finds you well. | {thread=chat ch=how} Good day to you. In good health, I hope? | {thread=chat ch=how} And how do you do, this fine morning?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_sly
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.honesty=sly pair.band=acquaintances
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=pry} Nice coat. Where'd you come by it? | {thread=chat ch=pry} You'll know a lot of folk, I'd wager. Working where you do. | {thread=chat ch=pry} Hear anything interesting lately?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_merry
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.humour=merry pair.band=acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=remark} We keep meeting. Folk will talk. | {thread=chat ch=remark} You again! Are you following me, or am I following you? | {thread=chat ch=remark} Fancy seeing you here. Here, where you always are.
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_dry
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.humour=dry pair.band=acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=remark} We must stop meeting like this. Standing about, mostly. | {thread=chat ch=remark} Another day. Same as the last, I expect. | {thread=chat ch=remark} Ah. You. The day's complete.
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_name
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk pair.named=no pair.band=acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=chat ch=name} I've seen you about for weeks and never asked your name. | {thread=chat ch=name} I know your face. I'm ashamed to say I've lost your name. | {thread=chat ch=name} We've nodded at each other all season. I'm going to ask. What's your name?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_neighbours
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk pair.neighbours=yes pair.band=acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=chat ch=wall} Was that your door at midnight? | {thread=chat ch=wall} We share a wall and I hardly know you. That's how it goes, I suppose. | {thread=chat ch=wall} I hear you singing, some nights. It's not bad.
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_customer
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk pair.customer=a pair.band=acquaintances
does tell.self
cooldown 2d
say {thread=chat ch=shop} I'll be by your shop later. Keep me something good. | {thread=chat ch=shop} That last lot you sold me was the best yet. | {thread=chat ch=shop} Are you open tomorrow? I'll need a few things.
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_newcomer
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk pair.rumour=newcomer
does ask.detail
cooldown 2d
say {thread=chat ch=new} You're new, aren't you? How are you finding it? | {thread=chat ch=new} Settling in? It takes a while. Folk here are slow to warm. | {thread=chat ch=new} Found your way about yet?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_warm
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.warmth=warm pair.band=acquaintances
does ask.how
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=how} You look like you could use a sit-down. How are you keeping? | {thread=chat ch=how} There you are! How's the day treating you?
then other: chat.answer

rule r7_chat_old
when concept=talk.day|talk.smalltalk self.stage=old other.stage=young|adolescent pair.band=acquaintances|strangers
does ask.detail
cooldown 1d
say {thread=chat ch=pup} Whose pup are you, then? | {thread=chat ch=pup} You've grown. Haven't you grown? | {thread=chat ch=pup} Shouldn't you be helping somebody?
then other: chat.answer

## Answering, as they are (self is the one spoken to). Each kind of greeting has its own answers; a trait's answer
## for one kind reads conv.ch, and the few with no kind fit them all.

rule r7_chat_open
when concept=chat.answer
does answer.how
say {went=open} Can't complain. | {went=open} Oh, you know. Same as ever. | {went=open} Fair to middling.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_how
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=how
does answer.how
say {went=open} Can't complain. | {went=open} Oh, you know. Same as ever. | {went=open} Busy enough. | {went=open} Fair to middling.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_remark
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=remark
does answer.how
say {went=open} Can't say I'd noticed. | {went=open} Hm. Maybe so. | {went=open} Ha. So it seems.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_name_answer
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=name
does answer.how
say {went=warm} It's #self.name#. And no shame in asking. | {went=warm} #self.name#. And I'll confess I've lost yours too. | {went=warm} #self.name#. Folk get it wrong all the time.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_wall_answer
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=wall
does answer.how
say {went=open} Ah. You heard that, did you? | {went=open} Thin walls. I hear you too, mind. | {went=open} Sorry. I'll try to be quieter.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_shop_answer
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=shop
does answer.how
say {went=warm} I'll keep you something. | {went=warm} Glad to hear it. Tell your friends. | {went=warm} Come early. The best goes quick.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_new_answer
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=new
does answer.how
say {went=open} Slowly. Everyone's been kind enough. | {went=open} I'm learning the streets. Mostly by getting lost. | {went=open} It's not home yet. It will be.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_pup_answer
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=pup
does answer.how
say {went=warm} #mum#'s. | {went=warm} I have! A whole paw's width since spring. | {went=warm} I am helping. I'm helping by standing here.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_pry_answer
when concept=chat.answer conv.ch=pry
does answer.how
say {went=wary} Oh, here and there. | {went=wary} Nothing worth repeating. | {went=wary} Why? What have you heard?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_chatty_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.talk=chatty conv.ch=how|remark
does answer.how
say {went=warm} Oh, don't get me started! My neighbour's goat got out again and... where was I? Busy. Yes. | {went=warm} I was just saying to myself, I was, I said, it's that sort of day. You know?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_quiet_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.talk=quiet
does answer.how
say {went=shut} Mm. | {went=shut} Aye. | {went=shut} *nods*
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_guarded_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.honesty=guarded conv.ch=how|pry|new
does answer.how
say {went=wary} Why do you ask? | {went=wary} Here and there. | {went=wary} Depends.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_sly_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.honesty=sly conv.ch=how|pry
does answer.how
say {went=wary} Depends who's asking. | {went=wary} Might be. What's it to you? | {went=wary} Oh, this and that.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_cold_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.warmth=cold
does answer.how
say {went=shut} Hm. | {went=shut} If you say so. | {went=shut} Excuse me.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_warm_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.warmth=warm conv.ch=how
does answer.how
say {went=warm} Better for a friendly face! | {went=warm} Lovely of you to ask. Truly. | {went=warm} All the better for seeing you.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_nervy_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.temper=nervy conv.ch=how|remark
does answer.how
say {went=open} Oh! Yes. I mean, fine. You startled me. | {went=open} Me? Fine. Why? Do I not look fine?
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_merry_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.humour=merry conv.ch=how
does answer.how
say {went=warm} Never better, never worse! | {went=warm} Fair as a feast day, and twice as hungry. | {went=warm} Can't grumble. I do, mind. Daily.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_merry_remark
when concept=chat.answer self.humour=merry conv.ch=remark
does answer.how
say {went=warm} Ha! There's never a dull day here, is there? | {went=warm} That's this town for you. Never a dull day. | {went=warm} Ha! You notice everything, you.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_short_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.temper=short conv.ch!=pup
does answer.how
say {went=shut} Can't stop. | {went=shut} What is it? | {went=shut} I'm busy.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_formal_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.tone=formal conv.ch=how
does answer.how
say {went=open} Very well, thank you. And yourself? | {went=open} Quite well. Kind of you to ask.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_old_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.stage=old conv.ch=how
does answer.how
say {went=open} Slower than I was. Faster than I will be. | {went=open} Still here. That's the main thing at my age.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_young_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.stage=young conv.ch=how|remark
does answer.how
say {went=warm} I found a frog! It got away. | {went=warm} #mum# says I'm not to talk to... oh, you're all right. Hello! | {went=warm} I'm being good. Mostly.
then other: reply.close

rule r7_chat_working_answer
when concept=chat.answer self.working=yes self.shift=during conv.ch=how|remark
does answer.how
say {went=open} Can't stop long. Work. | {went=open} Busy. Ask me at dusk.
then other: reply.close

## And on their way (self is the one who began)

rule r7_close_chat
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat
does ack
say Well. | Good to see you. | Mind how you go.

rule r7_close_chat_open
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat conv.went=open
does ack
say Well. Good to see you. | Mind how you go. | Same time tomorrow, then. | #farewell#.

rule r7_close_chat_warm
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat conv.went=warm
does ack
say We should talk more. We never do. | Ha! I like you. I don't know why I never said. | Come by sometime. I mean it.
regard other: familiarity +1

rule r7_close_chat_pup
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat conv.ch=pup
does ack
priority 1
say Off you go, then. And mind the carts. | Ha! Good pup. Run along. | Tell your mother I said good day.

rule r7_close_chat_shut
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat conv.went=shut
does ack
say Right. Well. | ...Good talk. | I'll leave you to it.

rule r7_close_chat_shut_chatty
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat conv.went=shut self.talk=chatty
does ack
say ...Right! Well. Lovely chat. Lovely. | Not one for talking, are you? That's all right. I'll do it for both of us.

rule r7_close_chat_wary
when concept=reply.close conv.thread=chat conv.went=wary
does ack
say Only being friendly. | No reason. No reason at all. | Suit yourself.
